    <fr:title text="What is elaboration? › Diagnostics"><fr:link href="/000O/" title="What is elaboration?" uri="https://coln-project.github.io/000O/" display-uri="000O" type="local">What is elaboration?</fr:link> › Diagnostics</fr:title>
    <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>A diagnostic is a message from the compiler to the user intended to explain a failure on the compiler’s part to fully understand the user’s intent.</html:p>
    <html:p>Sometimes, there is a reasonable guess that the compiler can make as to how to continue, in which case the diagnostic is a “warning”—a warning that perhaps the choice the compiler is making is not what the user intended. In other cases, the compiler cannot make a reasonable guess, and the diagnostic is an “error”.</html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
