                <fr:route>/000Q/</fr:route>
                <fr:title text="Notation">Notation</fr:title>
                <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
              </fr:frontmatter>
              <fr:mainmatter>
                <html:p>Notation is another data type in the Coln compiler. Notation is the first “tree-shaped” data type that is produced in the compilation pipeline, and is fairly permissive in terms of what is allowed.</html:p>
                <html:p>See <fr:link href="/000R/" title="F-notation" uri="https://coln-project.github.io/000R/" display-uri="000R" type="local">fnotation</fr:link> for a description of the notation used in Coln.</html:p>
              </fr:mainmatter>
            </fr:tree>
